.TH "bugymetaballs-by-lordcow" "6" "2026-11-13" "Buggy Metaballs User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
bugymetaballs-by-lordcow - run the Buggy Metaballs 4k intro
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
bugymetaballs-by-lordcow
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Buggy Metaballs is a 4k intro written by lordcow for the 2004 4k source
compo.
It renders a metaball surface with a scroll text mapped on it, and plays
a small one-track music.
.PP
The intro runs in a 640x480 window (the original version started in
fullscreen) and loops until it is stopped.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
Any key
quit the intro.
Closing the window also quits.
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH NOTES
.PP
The original intro has no timer and advances by a fixed step on each
frame.
The Debian version caps the frame rate to 60 frames per second, so that
the animation and the scroll text keep a steady speed on current
hardware.
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
.SH AUTHORS
Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>,Claude Opus 5.5,lordcow.
